[00:12.47]Read the online news report about the English Week at Young Guan Junior High School and see what students and teachers think about it.阅读这篇关于Young Guan初中英语周的在线新闻报道，了解学生和老师们的看法。
[00:24.82]English Week: A Chance for Students to Shine.英语周：学生们绽放光彩的机会。
[00:29.93]Last week, students at Young Guan Junior High School worked hard to make their English Week a big success.上周，Young Guan初中的学生们努力拼搏，让他们的英语周取得了巨大成功。
[00:40.39]This year's theme was promoting cultural exchange.今年的主题是促进文化交流。
[00:45.38]There were a number of events and activities during the week.这一周内举办了多项活动。
[00:50.34]There was an English book fair and a treasure hunt.有英语书展和寻宝游戏。
[00:54.52]Some students took part in a speaking competition.一些学生参加了演讲比赛。
[00:58.59]They spoke for two minutes on a topic of their choice, and there were wonderful speeches about recent technological developments in China and abroad.他们就自己选择的主题演讲两分钟，其中有不少关于中国及国外近期科技发展的精彩演讲。
[01:10.10]Other students put on an English play.其他学生上演了一部英语话剧。
[01:13.78]They designed the costumes themselves, and had great fun acting in the play.他们自己设计服装，在话剧中表演得十分开心。
[01:19.82]One of the most popular activities was a poster design competition.最受欢迎的活动之一是海报设计比赛。
[01:26.05]We spoke to the winner, Jiang Xin.我们采访了获奖者姜鑫。
[01:30.13]"I'm so happy I won," he said. "I made a poster about the Silk Road. It was great to learn about this important network of trade routes between China and Europe."“我太开心能获奖了，”他说，“我制作了一张关于丝绸之路的海报。了解这条连接中国和欧洲的重要贸易路线网络真是太棒了。”
[01:44.39]We spoke to several other students about English Week.我们还采访了其他几位学生，了解他们对英语周的看法。
[01:49.28]One of them was Su Mei.其中一位是苏梅。
[01:52.10]"It gave me a chance to learn about other parts of the world, and it has really helped me improve my English speaking skills. I didn't know that learning could be this fun."“它让我有机会了解世界其他地方，还真的帮我提高了英语口语能力。我以前从不知道学习能这么有趣。”
[02:06.74]The teachers were all very happy with the result.老师们对活动结果都非常满意。
[02:11.37]"English Week is a great opportunity for students. They get to take part in fun activities, practice using English and acquire valuable cultural knowledge at the same time," said a teacher.“英语周对学生们来说是个绝佳的机会。他们能参与有趣的活动，同时练习使用英语并获取宝贵的文化知识，”一位老师说。
[02:26.72]No wonder everyone is looking forward to next year's event.难怪大家都在期待明年的活动。
